sdk/rmp/shim/audio - third-party notices

The files here are written for the plugin SDK but derive from PJRC's Teensy code:
AudioStream.h / AudioStream.cpp from Teensyduino's cores/teensy4/AudioStream.h/.cpp,
dspinst_native.h from the Teensy Audio Library's utility/dspinst.h. A plugin (.rmp)
built with this shim also links Teensy Audio Library objects (synth_waveform.cpp,
mixer.cpp, ...) compiled unchanged from the installed Teensyduino's libraries/Audio,
so a distributed .rmp carries both notices below.

